&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a4df78a9adabbac39e27febb1b5640b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1259b18b/uploads/origins/c95055ca-2aa0-4e49-9dce-43d3f82c8111?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1077f3f93095db0dc90ab2b9d35ba4f1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "大家好 >u< 我回来了!\n\n我想委托艺术我的VTuber和Soraka，英雄联盟（这是一个视频游戏）。\n\nBayfin Bloom: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cbqgeVm3D4jvtyZF-XftgcgpBoRBslCT?usp=share_link\n星际守护者索拉卡: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xHUf0M11UfruaOxrs1vlvqdGNOmO0KUx?usp=sharing\n\n索拉卡比贝芬高一个头。\n艺术作品的想法：索拉卡给贝芬拍头。\n\n该作品将在社交媒体和twitch/youtube上使用，并注明来源。\n如果作品能以16:9的比例呈现，那就更好了。\n\n谢谢你！！！！谢谢你！ :心：", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@XIACHAER/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0b4fadeb/uploads/origins/1c0010f7-728c-43c0-9641-d5ee2e4f70df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05e0faf7f112667576c61c7bcd2909ae", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0b4fadeb/uploads/origins/1c0010f7-728c-43c0-9641-d5ee2e4f70df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05e0faf7f112667576c61c7bcd2909ae, https://si.imgix.net/0b4fadeb/uploads/origins/1c0010f7-728c-43c0-9641-d5ee2e4f70df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22dc9cf415fef678131794483bfbbb2a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0b4fadeb/uploads/origins/1c0010f7-728c-43c0-9641-d5ee2e4f70df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90b4c1df9321df382f726adadbdc0ed1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "嗨！你的艺术风格很美！如果你能把我的孩子尽可能的漂亮，把他的头发放下来，看起来很空灵，他有一个巨大的胸部，他的家是森林，所以请把他放在你认为合适的情况下。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/judasmoonlight/status/1646925392786358272?s=46&t=NmrAYKAlvxMw6I1eN006BA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@XIACHAER/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ff05369a/uploads/origins/dcd4a596-04ed-497e-aa61-6ad8c8d8a1b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp